Experience luxury living in this stunning 4-bedroom apartment nestled in a prime location within a vibrant neighborhood, Santos. Boasting a private garden and terrace, this furnished and equipped unit offers the perfect blend of comfort and style. Situated in a great condominium, enjoy easy access to nearby restaurants, shops, transportation, and the scenic riverfront. Don't miss this opportunity to elevate your lifestyle in this exceptional home.LU nº449 issued by CML in 02/10/2014.

